{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26307","headline":"湘中怨 一 · 沈亚之","name":"湘中怨 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隆佳秀兮昭盛时，播薰绿兮淑华归。\n顾室荑与处蕚兮，潜重房以饰姿。\n见稚态之韶羞兮，蒙长霭以爲帏。\n醉融光兮渺渺弥弥，迷千里兮涵烟眉。\n晨陶陶兮暮熙熙，舞婑那之穠条兮。\n骋盈盈以披迟，酡游颜兮倡蔓卉縠，流蒨霓兮石发髓旎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}